<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2010/07/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>Microsoft.Azure.Internal.$branch$AzureDNCSF</id>
    <version>$version$</version>
    <title>AzureDNC for SF from $branch$</title>
    <authors>connectdevs@microsoft.com</authors>
    <owners>connectdevs@microsoft.com</owners>
    <description>The delegated network controller service is highly available service that works in coordination with the orchestrator and will be responsible for the following.

1. Management of delegated customer network address spaces.

2. Management of network policies.

3. Generate IP configuration goal states based on the request from orchestrators.

4. Propagate the goal states to the agents running on the VMs where the IP configurations needs to be instantiated.

This service will expose restful API surface that will be used for bottoms up network provisioning.  </description>
